Source: https://github.com/resend/react-email/blob/674d8ec2804b86be5d99156383fb1810179847bf/apps/demo/emails/Community/welcome/stripe-welcome.tsx
Public upstream PreviewProps only. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the MIT license. -->
<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Welcome to Stripe</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>You&#x27;re now ready to make live transactions with Stripe!</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="inherit" />
      <mj-text padding="0px" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      body {
        font-family:
          -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Ubuntu,
          sans-serif !important;
        padding: 8px !important;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0;
      }
      a {
        color: inherit;
      }
      .community-rich-0 a:nth-of-type(1) {
        color: #556cd6;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .community-rich-1 a:nth-of-type(1) {
        color: #556cd6;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .community-rich-1 a:nth-of-type(2) {
        color: #556cd6;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .community-rich-3 a:nth-of-type(1) {
        color: #556cd6;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .community-rich-4 a:nth-of-type(1) {
        color: #556cd6;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body width="600px" background-color="#f6f9fc">
    <mj-section padding="20px 48px 48px" background-color="#ffffff">
      <mj-column padding="0px">
        <mj-image
          src="https://demo.react.email/static/stripe-logo.png"
          alt="Stripe"
          width="49px"
          height="21px"
          align="left"
          padding="0px"
        />
        <mj-divider border-color="#eaeaea" border-width="1px" padding="20px 0px" />
        <mj-text padding="0px 0px 16px" font-size="16px" line-height="24px" color="#525f7f"
          >Thanks for submitting your account information. You're now ready to make live
          transactions with Stripe!</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text padding="0px 0px 16px" font-size="16px" line-height="24px" color="#525f7f"
          >You can view your payments and a variety of other information about your account right
          from your dashboard.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-button
          href="https://dashboard.stripe.com/login"
          align="center"
          padding="0px"
          inner-padding="10px"
          border-radius="3px"
          font-size="16px"
          background-color="#656ee8"
          color="#ffffff"
          font-weight="700"
          width="100%"
          >View your Stripe Dashboard</mj-button
        >
        <mj-divider border-color="#eaeaea" border-width="1px" padding="20px 0px" />
        <mj-text
          padding="0px 0px 16px"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="24px"
          color="#525f7f"
          css-class="community-rich-0"
          >If you haven't finished your integration, you might find our
          <a href="https://docs.stripe.com/dashboard/basics">docs</a> handy.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text
          padding="0px 0px 16px"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="24px"
          color="#525f7f"
          css-class="community-rich-1"
          >Once you're ready to start accepting payments, you'll just need to use your live
          <a href="https://dashboard.stripe.com/login?redirect=%2Fapikeys">API keys</a> instead of
          your test API keys. Your account can simultaneously be used for both test and live
          requests, so you can continue testing while accepting live payments. Check out our
          <a href="https://docs.stripe.com/dashboard/basics">tutorial about account basics</a
          >.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text
          padding="0px 0px 16px"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="24px"
          color="#525f7f"
          css-class="community-rich-3"
          >Finally, we've put together a
          <a href="https://docs.stripe.com/get-started/checklist/website">quick checklist</a> to
          ensure your website conforms to card network standards.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text
          padding="0px 0px 16px"
          font-size="16px"
          line-height="24px"
          color="#525f7f"
          css-class="community-rich-4"
          >We'll be here to help you with any step along the way. You can find answers to most
          questions and get in touch with us on our
          <a href="https://support.stripe.com/">support site</a>.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text padding="0px 0px 16px" font-size="16px" line-height="24px" color="#525f7f"
          >— The Stripe team</mj-text
        >
        <mj-divider border-color="#eaeaea" border-width="1px" padding="4px 0px 20px" />
        <mj-text padding="0px 0px 16px" font-size="12px" line-height="16px" color="#8898aa"
          >Stripe, 354 Oyster Point Blvd, South San Francisco, CA 94080</mj-text
        >
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="0px">
      <mj-column padding="0px">
        <mj-spacer height="64px" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
